Attribution
-----------

This ESPHome external component is a new implementation for ESPHome. Protocol
behavior, receiver profile mappings, and command handling were reimplemented
from publicly available Yamaha RS-232 behavior, hardware testing, and the
earlier GPL-3.0 project memphi2/homie-yamaha-rs232.

No Yamaha manual PDFs, manual images, vendor diagrams, or verbatim manual
tables are included in this repository.

Third-party projects
--------------------

ESPHome is a separate project. ESPHome publishes its C++ runtime code under
GPLv3 and its Python/other code under MIT terms. This component is intended to
be consumed through ESPHome's external_components mechanism.

